  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "コンピューター室",
    "id": "44",
    "timezone": "2"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「やってられるか！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「……あぁもう、疲れた！　眼精疲労で肩こりと頭痛までしてきたわよ、目ぇ痛い！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "「何であたしが、こんな無駄な労働させられてんのよっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（つうか、意味わかんない。何よ、『四方みつるの映像を録画しろ』って。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（二年Ｂ組の教室に隠しカメラまで仕掛けてさ～、これって犯罪なんじゃないの？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（あのアホ王子が移動したら、こっちも校舎のあちこちに仕掛けられた隠しカメラに映像を切り換えて……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（繋いで、編集して、録画して。すっごい、面倒くさい！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（幼なじみが男子の制服を着て馬鹿やってるところを録画して、あとでそれをネタに強請るとか？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（ゲラゲラ笑いたいだけ？　よくわかんない！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（いくら陛下からの指令とはいってもね～、こちとら犯罪の片棒を担ぐほど忠誠心は高くないわよ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（あたし、本来は校則違反の制服着てるあいつをしょっ引く立場なのにさ～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（あたしも陛下も、もうすぐ卒業だし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（進学先はちがうしさぁ、これ以上あの暴君の言うこと聞いててもメリットないわよね？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（そうよ、長年の習慣でつい言うこと聞いちゃってるけど……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（もう陛下に媚びを売っても仕方ないじゃない、何の得もないわ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（まぁ進学しても友達付きあいっていうか、交流はあるだろうし……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（陛下に恩を売っておけば、親しくなっておけば薔薇色の人生？　あたし、勝ち組？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（そうは思うけど、同い年なのに上から目線で命令されてさ～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（ぺこぺこ頭下げてゴマをすってさ～、それで陛下が今まであたしに何してくれたっていうの？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（あぁもう、まだ就職もしてないのに胃潰瘍になりそうよ！　パワハラよ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（やめやめ。急に面倒くさくなってきたわ～、こんなのは徒労だわ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（お給料がもらえるならともかくさ～、あたしにはあたしの生活があんのよ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（さくらさんはともかくさ、あたしには陛下に滅私奉公する義理とかないもん。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（甘い汁だけ吸わせてもらって、命令はテキトーにやっときゃいいでしょ♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（うんっ、そうしましょ！　陛下の言いなりになるの、や～めたっ☆）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（気づくのが遅すぎたわよ、こんな卒業間際になって悟ってもさ～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（青春を無駄にしちゃったわ、偉いひとに振り回されるだけの人生ってか？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（これじゃあママと同じだわ、あたしもママの子なのね。いいけど、ちょっとは楽しかったし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（とくに、『春秋コンビ』になってからの一年間ぐらいは……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（あぁ、何だか……。さくらさんに、会いたいわ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（四月からも、会えるけど。同じ大学、だし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（学部はちがうから、ちょっとは疎遠になっちゃうかもだけど。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（さくらさんは、あたしがそばで見ていてあげないと……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（ほんと、放っておけない『お人好し』だもん。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（あたしみたいな性悪に文句も言わずに、ずっとお友達として寄り添ってくれたぐらいに）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（さくらさんにとっては、どんな三年間だったのかしら？　聞きたいわ、お喋りがしたいわ……とっても♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（さくらさんは、ほんとに『滅私奉公』っていう感じだったけど。ちゃんと、青春を満喫できたのかしら？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（電話、しちゃおっかな。って、さくらさんからメールが届いてる。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 11,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（考えることは同じね～、あたしたちはやっぱり以心伝心ね！　最高のコンビよっ☆）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かえで",
    "text": "（えへへ……♪）"
  },
